OL,3,GNEWSAPatel to be replaced by Tugendhat
OL,4,Aas shadow foreign secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Tory leadership candidate Tom
OL,7,FTugendhat will replace Dame Priti Patel
OL,8,Fas shadow foreign secretary, BBC News
OL,9,Fhas been told.
OL,11,FAs first reported by the Daily
OL,12,FTelegraph, he will return to the
OL,13,FConservative front bench when Kemi
OL,14,FBadenoch reshuffles her team next
OL,15,Fmonth.
OL,17,FDame Priti wrote on social media that
OL,18,Fshe would be leaving the front bench
OL,19,Fposition to take up a new role focused
OL,20,Fon strengthening "links with sister
OL,21,Fparties and centre right movements
OL,22,Faround the world".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
