OL,3,GNEWSAPatel to be replaced by Tugendhat
OL,4,Aas shadow foreign secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes after shadow housing secretary
OL,7,FSir James Cleverly said he was
OL,8,Fresigning in order to run for London
OL,9,Fmayor.
